================================================================================
HOSPITAL MANAGEMENT SYSTEM — ENTITY RELATIONSHIP SPECIFICATION
Course: CS402 | Database Systems Assignment 1
================================================================================

Entities & Attributes:
1. PATIENT (PatientID [PK], FullName, DateOfBirth, Gender, ContactNumber, EmergencyContact)
2. DOCTOR (DoctorID [PK], FullName, Specialization, LicenseNumber, DepartmentID [FK])
3. DEPARTMENT (DepartmentID [PK], DeptName, FloorNumber, HeadDoctorID [FK])
4. APPOINTMENT (AppointmentID [PK], PatientID [FK], DoctorID [FK], Date, Time, Status)
5. PRESCRIPTION (PrescriptionID [PK], AppointmentID [FK], MedicationDetails, Dosage)

Constraints:
- Foreign keys with ON DELETE CASCADE for appointments when patient is deregistered.
- BCNF satisfied for all functional dependencies.
